@김@기(반복과진화) 

① 아래를 PowerShell에 그대로 붙여 넣고, 나온 결과를 전부 보내 주세요.
윈도우 시험기(PowerShell 5.1)에서 오류 없이 도는 것을 확인했습니다. 설정을 바꾸지 않고 보기만 하는 명령이며, 토큰이나 비밀번호는 출력하지 않습니다.

[Net.ServicePointManager]::SecurityProtocol = [Net.SecurityProtocolType]::Tls12
$h = 'volcano-mcp.groove1027.workers.dev'
'== 1. CERT ISSUER (normal: Let''s Encrypt) =='
try { $tcp = New-Object Net.Sockets.TcpClient($h, 443)
  $ssl = New-Object Net.Security.SslStream($tcp.GetStream(), $false, ({ $true }))
  $ssl.AuthenticateAsClient($h, $null, [Security.Authentication.SslProtocols]::Tls12, $false)
  $c = New-Object Security.Cryptography.X509Certificates.X509Certificate2($ssl.RemoteCertificate)
  'ISSUER = ' + $c.Issuer; $tcp.Close() } catch { 'ERROR = ' + $_.Exception.Message }
'== 2. PROXY =='
netsh winhttp show proxy
$i = Get-ItemProperty 'HKCU:\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Internet Settings'
'ProxyEnable = ' + $i.ProxyEnable; 'ProxyServer = ' + $i.ProxyServer; 'AutoConfigURL = ' + $i.AutoConfigURL
foreach ($n in 'HTTP_PROXY','HTTPS_PROXY','ALL_PROXY','NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS','NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED','NODE_OPTIONS') {
  foreach ($s in 'Process','User','Machine') { $v = [Environment]::GetEnvironmentVariable($n, $s); if ($v) { "$n ($s) = $v" } } }
'== 3. ANTIVIRUS =='
Get-CimInstance -Namespace root/SecurityCenter2 -ClassName AntivirusProduct | ForEach-Object { $_.displayName }
'== 5. CLOUDFLARE ROUTE =='
(Invoke-WebRequest -UseBasicParsing "https://$h/cdn-cgi/trace").Content -split "`n" | Where-Object { $_ -match '^(colo|http|tls|warp|gateway)=' }

